{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0330_pc_02",
      "hash": "09a33de112d0efab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "電腦螢幕上\\n顯示出了傳送機器！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_10",
      "hash": "f7d8f6e3f59b634d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呦！得快點才行！\\n麻煩[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啦～"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0330_pc_01",
      "hash": "09a33ee112d0f15e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啟動了\\n傳送機器的分離程式！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_01",
      "hash": "f7d571e3f5984b77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正輝「哎呀～！多謝多謝！\\n你可是我的救命恩人啊！\\c\\n……哦！兄弟你真有一套！\\n你的包包裡\\r\\n已經裝好[VAR COLOR(0006)]盒子[VAR COLOR(0000)]功能了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_02",
      "hash": "f7d572e3f5984d2a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正輝「哎呀～！多謝多謝！\\n妳可是我的救命恩人啊！\\c\\n……哦！小姐妳真有一套！\\n妳的包包裡\\r\\n已經裝好[VAR COLOR(0006)]盒子[VAR COLOR(0000)]功能了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_06",
      "hash": "f7d56ee3f598465e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是捉了太多寶可夢，\\n把盒子給塞滿了的話，\\r\\n只要[VAR COLOR(0006)]傳送給大木博士[VAR COLOR(0000)]就行啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_07",
      "hash": "f7d56fe3f5984811",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0330_sys_03",
      "hash": "6149ed9ac41a89fe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_05",
      "hash": "f7d56de3f59844ab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……啊，對了！\\n為了答謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳剛剛救了我，\\r\\n雖然有點不成敬意……\\r\\n但這個送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0330_sys_01",
      "hash": "6149eb9ac41a8698",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從正輝那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]船票[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_masaki_01_p06_r025_r0101",
      "hash": "4907e3945140cfdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_03",
      "hash": "f7d573e3f5984edd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "現在聖特安努號\\n正停泊在枯葉市的碼頭。\\c\\n雖然人家送了我船票，\\n但我對派對啥的實在沒興趣。\\c\\n這裡頭應該有個２張票吧，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以找個誰跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一起去玩。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0330_masaki_04",
      "hash": "f7d56ce3f59842f8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正輝「要是捉了太多寶可夢，\\n把盒子給塞滿了的話，\\r\\n只要都傳送給大木博士就行啦！"
    }
  ],
